@startuml
title AI-Assisted Emergency Stroke Triage Workflow

start

:Patient arrives with suspected stroke;

:CT Brain Scan;

:Images transferred to PACS;

:NeuroTriage AI analyzes CT in background;

if (Suspected ICH?) then (Yes)

:Estimate Confidence;

:Assign Priority;

:Add to top of worklist;

else (No)

:Estimate Confidence;

:Assign Routine Priority;

endif

:Radiologist reviews study;

if (AI Recommendation Accepted?) then (Yes)

:Diagnosis Confirmed;

else (Override)

:Radiologist modifies decision;

endif

:Capture Feedback;

:Emergency Physician notified;

stop
@enduml
